{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A diary industry, in a quantity of milk with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/b/13b7a4fd8e4e9383a82f096e47fa5fde6ae1009c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> fat adds a quantity of milk with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85df79acaf844db56f593571f3f19fd338e06b15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> fat and produces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/0/6e0588c55c2d51f1677c8bd4a06da1d49197ce4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1200$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />kg of milk with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/0/0b04a3bd51b4c6a454c3aae545a1dbc6a5bff05d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> fat.\nThe quantity of milk with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85df79acaf844db56f593571f3f19fd338e06b15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> fat, that was added is (in kg)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a5ed21c130a8a29c731cb4c415192dab5dd688a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 1000\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 600\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 800\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 120\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 480$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"442\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of kg of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/b/13b7a4fd8e4e9383a82f096e47fa5fde6ae1009c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> milk and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the number of kg of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85df79acaf844db56f593571f3f19fd338e06b15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> milk.\n</p><p>We then have the equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/1/c5191641f7c14b30ee0136c9cac4182d2d536373.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=1200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/2/b12bb0e52871c15702f84a2636399de662f721e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4x+y}{100}=1200*.02=24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"198\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Solving, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bb29a0d09c4069b7febc56fab5a403461ed2a81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X=400$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1bcf6f439bf3f9194b0050f4c169b3d2c0c0f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1200-400=800\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{(C)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"225\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"20